%% aoneahsan-cccs-programming-principles — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Designing a module, or code is<br/>getting hard to reason about]) --> smell{What is the symptom?}

    smell -->|change ripples<br/>across files| soc[Separation of concerns:<br/>split by reason-to-change]
    smell -->|file or function<br/>too large| units[Apply the three-question test]
    smell -->|similar code<br/>in two places| dry{Will they ALWAYS<br/>change together?}
    smell -->|deep call chains<br/>a.b.c.d| demeter[Law of Demeter:<br/>talk to immediate collaborators]
    smell -->|sprawling status<br/>conditional| behavioural
    smell -->|construction varies<br/>by context| creational
    smell -->|interface mismatch<br/>or messy subsystem| structural

    dry -->|yes| extract[Extract — this is real duplication]
    dry -->|no| leave[LEAVE IT.<br/>Merging couples independent concerns<br/>and the next change adds a flag param]

    units --> q1[What does it do?]
    q1 --> q2[How do you use it?]
    q2 --> q3[What does it depend on?]
    q3 --> boundary{Answerable without<br/>reading internals?}
    boundary -->|no| redraw[Boundary is wrong — redraw it]
    boundary -->|yes| ok[Boundary is sound]
    redraw --> units

    creational[Factory / Abstract Factory / Builder /<br/>Prototype / Singleton]
    structural[Adapter / Facade / Decorator / Proxy /<br/>Composite / Bridge / Flyweight]
    behavioural[Strategy / Observer / Command / State]

    creational --> justify
    structural --> justify
    behavioural --> justify
    justify{Can you NAME the<br/>specific pain it removes?}
    justify -->|no| skip[Do not apply it.<br/>YAGNI — no pattern without a named pain]
    justify -->|yes| apply[Apply it, and name it in the code]

    soc --> check
    demeter --> check
    extract --> check
    leave --> check
    ok --> check
    skip --> check
    apply --> check
    check([Re-read: is this the SIMPLEST thing<br/>that works? KISS beats cleverness])

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class smell,dry,boundary,justify gateNode
    class trigger,check terminal
    class leave,skip warn
